  <description lang="en-GB" default="true">A blade boasting 97cm in length, that is said to have been the beloved sword of Kojiro Sasaki.\nAttacking Strength: ★★★-\nBlade Length： ★★★★\nCritical Hit: ★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ja-JP" default="false">佐々木小次郎の愛刀として伝えられる、三尺二寸の長さを誇る刀。\n攻撃力：★★★-\n刃渡り：★★★★\n会心度：★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-US" default="false">A blade boasting 97cm in length, that is said to have been the beloved sword of Kojiro Sasaki.\nAttacking Strength: ★★★-\nBlade Length： ★★★★\nCritical Hit: ★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-SG" default="false">A blade boasting 97cm in length, that is said to have been the beloved sword of Kojiro Sasaki.\nAttacking Strength: ★★★-\nBlade Length： ★★★★\nCritical Hit: ★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="fr-FR" default="false">Une lame de 97 cm de long, qui aurait été l’épée favorite de Kojiro Sasaki.\nPuissance d’attaque : ★★★-\nLongueur de la lame : ★★★★\nCoup critique : ★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="es-ES" default="false">Una hoja de 97 cm de largo, que se dice fue la espada favorita de Kojiro Sasaki.\nFuerza de ataque: ★★★-\nLongitud de la hoja: ★★★★\nGolpe crítico: ★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="it-IT" default="false">Una lama lunga 97 cm, che si dice fosse la spada preferita di Kojiro Sasaki.\nPotenza d'attacco: ★★★-\nLunghezza lama: ★★★★\nColpo critico: ★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="de-DE" default="false">Eine Klinge mit einer Länge von 97 cm, die angeblich das Lieblingsschwert von Kojiro Sasaki war.\nAngriffsstärke: ★★★-\nKlingenlänge: ★★★★\nKritischer Treffer: ★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-HK" default="false">據說是佐佐木小次郎所鍾愛的愛刀，長達97公分。\n攻擊力：★★★-\n刀刃長度：★★★★\n會心一擊：★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-TW" default="false">據說是佐佐木小次郎所鍾愛的愛刀，長達97公分。\n攻擊力：★★★-\n刀刃長度：★★★★\n會心一擊：★+\n[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ko-KR" default="false">사사키 코지로가 아꼈다고 전해지는 97cm 길이의 검입니다.\n공격력: ★★★-\n칼날 길이: ★★★★\n치명타: ★+\n[#Legal]</description>
